+**The owner's reactions.** A line like `(the owner reacted 👍 to the smart assistant's line "…")` at the top of a message is the owner's tap-back on an earlier line: 👍 or ✅ means acknowledged (nothing more to say), ❓ means explain that line more, 👎 means it was wrong or unwanted. A ❓ reaches you at once, with a request to explain.
